WEBVTT

00:03:16.053 --> 00:03:18.223
Dad wants us to pick
up where he left off

00:03:18.223 --> 00:03:21.613
Saving people, hunting
things, the family business.

00:03:22.393 --> 00:03:24.583
My dad had a partner on his last hunt.

00:03:24.583 --> 00:03:26.163
The guy screwed up, got my dad killed.

00:03:26.163 --> 00:03:28.233
What does this have to do
-It was your father, Dean.

00:03:28.233 --> 00:03:31.883
Maybe that's what the demon's doing
-Pushing us, finding ways to break us.

00:03:31.883 --> 00:03:32.643
I'm Meg.

00:03:32.643 --> 00:03:35.953
She's possessed --A human
possessed by a demon.

00:03:35.953 --> 00:03:40.463
Key of Solomon --You get a demon
in one, theyre trapped, powerless.

00:03:40.463 --> 00:03:44.113
Before dad died, he told
something -Something about you.

00:03:44.113 --> 00:03:47.273
He said that I had to save you, and
if I couldnt, Id have to kill you.

00:03:47.273 --> 00:03:48.773
Did he know the demon's plans for me?

00:03:48.773 --> 00:03:50.493
Am I supposed to go dark side?

00:03:50.493 --> 00:03:51.353
I never said that.

00:03:51.353 --> 00:03:54.103
You're not careful; you will
have to waste me one day, Dean.

00:03:58.903 --> 00:04:00.793
Ellen, its me again.

00:04:01.973 --> 00:04:03.383
Any chance you've heard from him?

00:04:05.213 --> 00:04:08.003
I swear, its like looking
for my dad all over again.

00:04:08.003 --> 00:04:09.613
I'm losing my mind here.

00:04:09.613 --> 00:04:11.103
I've called him a thousand times.

00:04:11.103 --> 00:04:12.153
It's nothing but voice mail.

00:04:12.153 --> 00:04:13.903
I don't know where he went or why.

00:04:13.903 --> 00:04:15.553
Sam's just gone.

00:04:16.853 --> 00:04:17.693
Hang on.

00:04:20.983 --> 00:04:22.353
Sammy, where the hell are you?

00:04:22.353 --> 00:04:23.293
Are you okay?

00:04:23.293 --> 00:04:24.123
Hey, hey, hey, hey.

00:04:24.123 --> 00:04:24.803
Calm down.

00:04:24.803 --> 00:04:25.523
Where are you?

00:04:25.523 --> 00:04:26.123
Don't move.

00:04:26.123 --> 00:04:27.293
I'm on my way.

00:04:51.713 --> 00:04:52.843
Sam, its me.

00:04:54.893 --> 00:04:55.593
Sam!

00:05:00.983 --> 00:05:01.943
Sam?

00:05:06.673 --> 00:05:07.473
Hey.

00:05:08.683 --> 00:05:09.943
Hey, Dean.

00:05:12.593 --> 00:05:13.443
Are you bleeding?

00:05:14.393 --> 00:05:15.583
I tried to wash it off.

00:05:19.093 --> 00:05:19.903
Oh, my god.

00:05:22.913 --> 00:05:24.183
I don't think its my blood.

00:05:24.183 --> 00:05:24.963
Whose is it?

00:05:24.963 --> 00:05:26.013
I don't know.

00:05:26.013 --> 00:05:27.533
Sam, what the hell happened?

00:05:28.663 --> 00:05:29.393
Dean...

00:05:31.743 --> 00:05:33.263
I don't remember anything.

00:05:48.753 --> 00:05:49.523
What did you find out?

00:05:50.413 --> 00:05:53.543
You checked in two days ago
under the name Richard sambora.

00:05:53.543 --> 00:05:57.233
I think the scariest part about this whole
thing is the fact that you're a bon jovi fan.

00:05:57.233 --> 00:05:58.133
Dean.

00:05:58.133 --> 00:05:59.463
Your room's been quiet.

00:05:59.463 --> 00:06:00.993
Nobody's noticed anything unusual.

00:06:00.993 --> 00:06:03.993
You mean no one saw me walking
around covered in blood?

00:06:04.853 --> 00:06:06.013
Yeah, thats what I mean.

00:06:06.013 --> 00:06:07.743
Then how the hell did I get here?

00:06:07.743 --> 00:06:08.513
What happened to me?

00:06:08.513 --> 00:06:12.193
I don't know, but you're
okay, and that's what matters.

00:06:12.193 --> 00:06:12.963
Everything else, we can deal with.

00:06:12.963 --> 00:06:13.873
Oh, really?

00:06:13.873 --> 00:06:16.353
'Cause what if I hurt someone or worse?

00:06:16.353 --> 00:06:17.523
Sam.

00:06:20.813 --> 00:06:22.443
What if this is what
dad warned you about?

00:06:22.443 --> 00:06:23.403
Come on, man.

00:06:23.403 --> 00:06:24.413
Let's not jump the gun here.

00:06:24.413 --> 00:06:25.763
We don't know what happened.

00:06:25.763 --> 00:06:27.823
We got to treat this like any other job.

00:06:27.823 --> 00:06:29.313
What's the last thing you remember?

00:06:29.313 --> 00:06:33.953
Me and you in that
motel room in west Texas.

00:06:33.953 --> 00:06:36.303
We went out to grab some burgers.

00:06:36.303 --> 00:06:38.613
West Texas -That was over a week ago.

00:06:41.203 --> 00:06:42.183
That's it.

00:06:44.453 --> 00:06:46.343
Next thing I knew, I was sitting here...

00:06:46.343 --> 00:06:47.803
Bloody.

00:06:49.353 --> 00:06:51.253
I felt like I had been
asleep for a month.

00:06:51.273 --> 00:06:53.053
Okay, retrace your steps.

00:06:53.053 --> 00:06:56.023
Manager said you left yesterday
afternoon and never saw you come back.

00:07:02.473 --> 00:07:03.153
Hey.

00:07:13.153 --> 00:07:14.533
Recognize anything?

00:07:16.423 --> 00:07:17.353
Not really.

00:07:22.613 --> 00:07:23.313
Wait.

00:07:24.003 --> 00:07:24.683
What?

00:07:24.853 --> 00:07:25.873
I think I was here.

00:07:28.073 --> 00:07:28.983
You remember?

00:07:30.173 --> 00:07:31.503
Not really. It just...

00:07:32.633 --> 00:07:34.113
Feels familiar, you know?

00:07:40.073 --> 00:07:40.813
Try that one.

00:07:42.843 --> 00:07:43.673
Yeah.

00:07:44.023 --> 00:07:45.043
Okay.

00:07:47.963 --> 00:07:49.023
Wait.

00:08:06.583 --> 00:08:08.443
Please tell me you didn't steal this.

00:08:18.653 --> 00:08:19.523
More blood.

00:08:23.483 --> 00:08:25.283
Sam, backseat.

00:08:35.903 --> 00:08:37.613
You think I used this on someone?

00:08:39.233 --> 00:08:40.503
I'm not thinking anything.

00:08:48.023 --> 00:08:49.413
Okay, now, this is disturbing.

00:08:52.653 --> 00:08:53.183
Come on, man.

00:08:53.183 --> 00:08:54.394
This couldn't have been you.

00:08:54.493 --> 00:08:58.273
It could have been someone else
-Somebody who, uh, smokes menthols.

00:08:58.273 --> 00:09:02.423
Hey, a gas receipts, a few towns over.

00:09:07.223 --> 00:09:10.013
All right, receipts for10
gallons at pump number 2.

00:09:11.173 --> 00:09:13.384
You getting any goose bumps yet?

00:09:13.703 --> 00:09:16.703
"God, this looks familiar,"djavu vibes?

00:09:19.223 --> 00:09:20.703
Maybe someone inside will remember you.

00:09:21.613 --> 00:09:22.583
Come on.

00:09:30.713 --> 00:09:32.123
You -Out of here.

00:09:32.123 --> 00:09:32.673
Now.

00:09:32.673 --> 00:09:33.653
I'm calling the cops.

00:09:33.653 --> 00:09:34.563
You talking to him?

00:09:34.563 --> 00:09:35.813
Yeah, Im talking to him.

00:09:35.813 --> 00:09:40.153
Jerk comes in yesterday, stinking drunk,
grabs a 40 from the fridge, starts chugging it.

00:09:40.153 --> 00:09:40.843
This guy?

00:09:40.843 --> 00:09:42.243
You're drinking malt liquor?

00:09:42.243 --> 00:09:44.993
Not after he whipped the
bottle at my friggin' head.

00:09:44.993 --> 00:09:46.153
This guy?

00:09:46.153 --> 00:09:47.884
What, am I speaking Urdu?

00:09:47.884 --> 00:09:51.183
I'm really sorry if I did anything
tell your story walking, pal, okay?

00:09:51.183 --> 00:09:52.173
Popo will be here in five.

00:09:52.173 --> 00:09:52.733
Wait.

00:09:52.733 --> 00:09:53.693
He's leaving.

00:09:53.693 --> 00:09:54.653
Put the phone down.

00:09:54.653 --> 00:09:56.003
Sam, go wait in the car.

00:09:56.003 --> 00:09:57.573
But, Dean  go wait in the car!

00:10:03.823 --> 00:10:06.583
Okay, look, I just want to
talk to you that are it, okay?

00:10:10.733 --> 00:10:12.463
When he took off yesterday,
which way did he go?

00:10:12.463 --> 00:10:13.623
Why don't you ask him?

00:10:13.623 --> 00:10:14.973
'Cause I'm asking you.

00:10:14.973 --> 00:10:16.573
Please, youd be doing
mea huge favor, okay?

00:10:16.573 --> 00:10:18.223
Oh, do you a favor.

00:10:18.223 --> 00:10:20.223
Well, that is what I live for.

00:10:20.223 --> 00:10:25.603
You know, your buddy didn't pay for the booze
or the smokes, which he also illegally lit up.

00:10:25.603 --> 00:10:26.753
You saw him smoking?

00:10:26.753 --> 00:10:28.353
Yeah, guys a chimney.

00:10:34.253 --> 00:10:35.443
This, uh...

00:10:36.663 --> 00:10:37.733
Ought to cover it.

00:10:38.263 --> 00:10:41.743
Hmm, its, uh, its
coming back to me now.

00:10:41.743 --> 00:10:43.693
He took two packs.

00:10:46.553 --> 00:10:47.663
Of course he did.

00:10:52.394 --> 00:10:55.703
Heent north on route
71, straight out of town.

00:11:06.083 --> 00:11:08.193
What's going on with you, sam, hmm?

00:11:08.884 --> 00:11:13.373
The smoking, throwing bottles at people
-That sounds more like me than you.

00:11:13.783 --> 00:11:14.123
Dean, wait.

00:11:14.123 --> 00:11:15.273
Wait. Here.

00:11:15.533 --> 00:11:16.283
Turn down that road.

00:11:16.283 --> 00:11:16.763
What?

00:11:16.763 --> 00:11:17.363
I don't know how I know.

00:11:17.363 --> 00:11:18.303
I just do.

00:11:47.634 --> 00:11:49.913
Whoever lives here, Id say
they don't like surprises.

00:12:01.854 --> 00:12:02.803
Should we knock?

00:12:04.713 --> 00:12:05.903
Yeah, I guess.

00:12:11.503 --> 00:12:12.354
Hey, Dean.

00:12:19.823 --> 00:12:23.343
I'm surprised the cops didnt show -Place
like this you'd think would have an alarm.

00:12:29.733 --> 00:12:30.963
Yeah, you would.

00:13:04.884 --> 00:13:06.083
Hit the lights.

00:13:21.854 --> 00:13:22.953
Dean, I did this.

00:13:22.953 --> 00:13:23.723
We don't know that.

00:13:23.723 --> 00:13:24.773
What else do you need?

00:13:24.773 --> 00:13:27.733
How else do you explain the
car, the knife, the blood?

00:13:27.733 --> 00:13:28.233
I don't know, man.

00:13:28.233 --> 00:13:29.453
Why don't you tell me?

00:13:33.394 --> 00:13:39.483
Even if you did do this, Im sure you had a reason -You
know, self-Defense, he was a bad son of a bitch --Something.

00:13:47.124 --> 00:13:48.173
He doesn't have any I.D.

00:13:48.533 --> 00:13:49.693
I need your lock pick.

00:13:49.793 --> 00:13:50.343
What?

00:13:50.343 --> 00:13:51.593
I need your lock pick.

00:14:01.573 --> 00:14:03.913
Either this guys a
Unabomber -Or a hunter.

00:14:04.673 --> 00:14:06.283
Dean, I think I killed a hunter.

00:14:09.823 --> 00:14:10.703
Let's find out.

00:14:17.313 --> 00:14:18.723
Here we go.

00:15:18.874 --> 00:15:20.663
How do you erase this, huh?

00:15:20.663 --> 00:15:21.833
Sam, come on.

00:15:21.833 --> 00:15:23.023
I need your help.

00:15:23.473 --> 00:15:24.503
I killed him, Dean.

00:15:26.303 --> 00:15:28.453
I just broke in and killed him.

00:15:29.973 --> 00:15:30.843
Listen to me.

00:15:31.533 --> 00:15:35.293
Whoever this guy is, hes a hunter, which means
other hunters are gonna look for his killer,

00:15:35.293 --> 00:15:37.503
Which means we got to
cover our tracks, okay?

00:15:40.813 --> 00:15:42.443
His name was Steve Wandell.

00:15:44.043 --> 00:15:45.843
This is a letter from his daughter.

00:16:07.693 --> 00:16:09.533
Wipe your prints. Then we go.

00:16:20.604 --> 00:16:24.104
All right, we get a couple hours' sleep, and
then we put this place in our rearview mirror.

00:16:26.163 --> 00:16:27.634
I know this is bad, okay?

00:16:28.403 --> 00:16:29.644
You got to snap out of it.

00:16:32.403 --> 00:16:33.503
Sam, say something.

00:16:34.683 --> 00:16:36.483
Just get some sleep and
leave in the morning?

00:16:37.593 --> 00:16:39.323
Murder, Dean
--That's what I did.

00:16:40.303 --> 00:16:41.673
Maybe, okay?

00:16:41.673 --> 00:16:43.384
Hey, we don't
--Shapeshifter.

00:16:43.384 --> 00:16:44.493
Oh, come on.

00:16:44.493 --> 00:16:45.153
You know it wasnt.

00:16:45.153 --> 00:16:45.843
You saw the tape.

00:16:45.843 --> 00:16:47.394
There was no eye flare, no distortion.

00:16:47.394 --> 00:16:49.473
But it wasn't you, all right?

00:16:49.473 --> 00:16:52.153
Yeah, it might have been
you, but it wasn't you.

00:16:52.943 --> 00:16:54.003
Well, I think it was.

00:16:59.813 --> 00:17:01.213
I think maybe more than you know.

00:17:02.644 --> 00:17:03.803
What the hell does that mean?

00:17:05.183 --> 00:17:07.003
For the last few weeks,
Ive been having...

00:17:08.973 --> 00:17:10.364
I've been having these feelings.

00:17:11.223 --> 00:17:12.223
What feelings?

00:17:12.523 --> 00:17:13.273
Rage...

00:17:14.653 --> 00:17:15.644
Hate.

00:17:16.933 --> 00:17:18.013
And I can't stop it.

00:17:19.644 --> 00:17:20.854
It just gets worse.

00:17:21.023 --> 00:17:22.563
Day by day, it gets worse.

00:17:24.203 --> 00:17:25.173
You never told me this.

00:17:27.343 --> 00:17:28.563
I didn't want to scare you.

00:17:30.903 --> 00:17:32.243
Well, bang-Up job on that.

00:17:36.163 --> 00:17:39.523
Dean, the yellow-Eyed demon
-You know he has plans for me.

00:17:39.803 --> 00:17:42.533
And we both know that hes turned
other children into killers before, too.

00:17:42.533 --> 00:17:44.293
No one can control you but you.

00:17:44.293 --> 00:17:45.253
It sure doesn't seem like that, Dean.

00:17:45.253 --> 00:17:49.763
It feels like no matter what I do, slowly
but surely, Im just becoming --What?

00:17:50.573 --> 00:17:51.644
Who I'm meant to be.

00:17:52.333 --> 00:17:53.933
You said it onceyourself, Dean.

00:17:53.933 --> 00:17:55.134
I got to face up to who I am.

00:17:55.134 --> 00:17:56.013
I didn't mean this!

00:17:56.013 --> 00:17:57.364
But it's still true.

00:17:57.364 --> 00:17:58.583
You know that.

00:17:58.583 --> 00:17:59.644
Dad knew that, too.

00:17:59.644 --> 00:18:01.884
That's why he told you
if it ever came to this

00:18:01.884 --> 00:18:02.833
Shut up, Sam.

00:18:05.083 --> 00:18:06.634
Dean, you promised him.

00:18:07.593 --> 00:18:08.604
You promised me.

00:18:11.433 --> 00:18:12.263
No.

00:18:13.394 --> 00:18:14.313
Listen to me.

00:18:14.933 --> 00:18:16.833
We're gonna figure this out, okay?

00:18:16.833 --> 00:18:19.033
I mean, theres got to be a way, right?

00:18:20.563 --> 00:18:21.443
Yeah, there is.

00:18:30.403 --> 00:18:31.963
I don't want to hurt anyone else.

00:18:34.124 --> 00:18:35.493
I don't want to hurt you.

00:18:38.233 --> 00:18:39.144
You wont.

00:18:39.864 --> 00:18:42.483
Whatever this is, you can fight it.

00:18:42.573 --> 00:18:44.663
No, I cant...

00:18:46.173 --> 00:18:47.624
Not forever.

00:18:49.323 --> 00:18:50.693
Here. You got to do it.

00:19:07.443 --> 00:19:09.293
You know, Ive tried so
hard to keep you safe.

00:19:10.053 --> 00:19:10.854
I know.

00:19:20.683 --> 00:19:21.624
I cant.

00:19:23.593 --> 00:19:25.173
I'd rather die.

00:19:31.013 --> 00:19:31.854
No.

00:19:33.884 --> 00:19:35.243
You'll live.

00:19:49.263 --> 00:19:51.003
You'll live to regret this.

00:20:19.564 --> 00:20:20.874
It's past your checkout.

00:20:32.453 --> 00:20:33.134
What?

00:20:33.324 --> 00:20:36.233
It's past checkout, and I have a
couple here that need your room.

00:20:39.493 --> 00:20:40.854
Yeah, Ill bet they do.

00:20:41.644 --> 00:20:42.344
What time is it?

00:20:42.344 --> 00:20:43.513
12:30.

00:20:45.713 --> 00:20:47.253
The guy that was with
me --Have you seen him?

00:20:47.253 --> 00:20:52.943
Yeah, he left before dawn in your car, and you should have
gone with him because now I'm gonna have to charge you extra.

00:20:53.834 --> 00:20:55.183
Oh, son of a bitch.

00:20:55.294 --> 00:20:56.574
It's just policy, sir.

00:20:56.574 --> 00:20:58.193
I need to use your computer.

00:20:58.193 --> 00:21:00.874
Why would I let you use my computer?

00:21:04.433 --> 00:21:05.074
Hi.

00:21:05.074 --> 00:21:10.483
Uh, so sorry to bother you, but, uh, my
son snuck out of the house last night and,

00:21:10.483 --> 00:21:12.993
Uh, went to a Justin Timberlake concert.

00:21:14.403 --> 00:21:14.943
What?

00:21:16.094 --> 00:21:16.683
Yeah.

00:21:16.983 --> 00:21:18.723
Justin is quite the triple threat.

00:21:19.304 --> 00:21:22.703
Uh, anyway, hes not back
yet, and I'm starting to worry.

00:21:24.483 --> 00:21:26.433
Right, yeah, boys will be boys.

00:21:26.433 --> 00:21:27.703
But, see, Sammy is a...

00:21:28.433 --> 00:21:33.013
Diabetic, and if he doesn't get his
insulin, then I just --I have to find him.

00:21:34.943 --> 00:21:36.183
Please, Im begging you.

00:21:37.493 --> 00:21:39.304
No, no, no, Im on
the website right now.

00:21:39.304 --> 00:21:41.533
I just need to activate
the GPS on his cellphone.

00:21:45.233 --> 00:21:46.033
Yeah, right there.

00:21:46.033 --> 00:21:47.594
Duluth, Minnesota.

00:21:47.743 --> 00:21:49.713
Yeah, that is a long
way to go for a concert.

00:21:49.713 --> 00:21:50.814
I appreciate your help.

00:21:58.283 --> 00:21:58.783
Night.

00:21:58.783 --> 00:21:59.854
Thank you.

00:22:02.074 --> 00:22:03.074
Sorry, were closing up.

00:22:05.874 --> 00:22:07.364
How about just one for the road?

00:22:11.183 --> 00:22:13.134
Well, youre about the last
person I'd expect to see.

00:22:15.844 --> 00:22:16.673
Well...

00:22:18.294 --> 00:22:19.903
I guess I'm full of surprises.

00:22:22.314 --> 00:22:23.864
So, can I get a beer?

00:22:25.033 --> 00:22:25.844
Sure.

00:22:26.554 --> 00:22:27.544
One beer.

00:22:39.913 --> 00:22:41.243
So, howd you find me?

00:22:43.564 --> 00:22:46.663
Well, uh, its kind of
what we do, you know?

00:22:47.513 --> 00:22:49.533
Speaking of "we,?Wheres Dean?

00:22:49.533 --> 00:22:50.824
Couldn't make it.

00:22:53.814 --> 00:22:54.894
So, what are you doing here, Sam?

00:22:55.713 --> 00:22:57.963
We didn't exactly part
on the best of terms.

00:22:59.673 --> 00:23:00.533
Right.

00:23:02.594 --> 00:23:03.604
Thats why I'm here.

00:23:05.134 --> 00:23:08.473
I kind of wanted to see if we
could square things, you know?

00:23:09.544 --> 00:23:10.594
That looks like it hurts.

00:23:12.804 --> 00:23:13.453
No.

00:23:14.104 --> 00:23:14.854
No, just...

00:23:15.814 --> 00:23:17.493
Had a run-In with a hot stove.

00:23:18.033 --> 00:23:20.564
So, you were saying something
about squaring things?

00:23:20.564 --> 00:23:21.584
Yeah.

00:23:26.374 --> 00:23:30.923
Look, I know how you feel about my
dad, and I can't say I blame you.

00:23:31.634 --> 00:23:38.753
He was obsessed, consumed with hunting, and
he didn't care who got caught in the crossfire.

00:23:40.963 --> 00:23:42.953
And I guess that included your dad.

00:23:44.324 --> 00:23:45.354
But that was my father.

00:23:45.763 --> 00:23:46.634
That's not me.

00:23:49.114 --> 00:23:49.903
What about Dean?

00:23:51.894 --> 00:23:54.864
Well, Deans more like my
father than I am, but he...

00:24:01.403 --> 00:24:02.273
Boy...

00:24:04.493 --> 00:24:06.584
Youre really carrying a
torch for him, arent you?

00:24:08.634 --> 00:24:09.733
I'll take that as a yes.

00:24:14.213 --> 00:24:15.054
It's too bad.

00:24:16.044 --> 00:24:18.084
'Cause, see, Dean, he
likes you, sure, but...

00:24:18.304 --> 00:24:19.564
Not in the way you'd want.

00:24:20.783 --> 00:24:27.554
I mean, maybe as kind of a little sister,
but romance -That's just out of the question.

00:24:29.523 --> 00:24:31.713
He Kind of thinks youre
a schoolgirl, you know?

00:24:35.443 --> 00:24:36.854
I'm not trying to hurt you, Jo.

00:24:36.854 --> 00:24:40.513
I -I'm telling you cause I care.

00:24:40.513 --> 00:24:42.203
That's real kind of you, Sam.

00:24:43.463 --> 00:24:44.283
I mean it.

00:24:49.294 --> 00:24:50.743
I care about you a lot.

00:24:50.923 --> 00:24:52.013
Sam, whats going on?

00:24:56.334 --> 00:24:58.104
I can be more to you, Jo.

00:24:58.854 --> 00:24:59.854
Maybe you should leave.

00:25:03.584 --> 00:25:04.463
Okay.

00:25:14.824 --> 00:25:15.894
Sam, get off me!

00:25:16.193 --> 00:25:17.653
Sam, get off me!

00:25:17.653 --> 00:25:18.713
Let go.

00:25:23.933 --> 00:25:25.663
Jo, Jo, Jo.

00:25:32.523 --> 00:25:33.854
Sam, no, pleases!

00:25:33.854 --> 00:25:34.673
Please.

00:25:48.273 --> 00:25:50.253
It didn't have to be this way.

00:25:52.894 --> 00:25:54.364
Maybe it did.

00:26:09.483 --> 00:26:10.804
What the hell's going on?

00:26:11.523 --> 00:26:12.854
What are you doing?

00:26:13.413 --> 00:26:18.173
So, what exactly did your mom
tell you about how your dad died?

00:26:19.104 --> 00:26:19.993
You're not Sam.

00:26:20.324 --> 00:26:21.304
Don't be so sure about that.

00:26:21.304 --> 00:26:22.334
Answer the question....

00:26:29.134 --> 00:26:29.773
Come on.

00:26:32.364 --> 00:26:33.314
It's me.

00:26:34.134 --> 00:26:34.854
You can tell me anything.

00:26:34.854 --> 00:26:35.973
You know that.

00:26:37.263 --> 00:26:39.364
Answer the question.

00:26:41.453 --> 00:26:42.153
Fine.

00:26:42.153 --> 00:26:43.283
Fine.

00:26:45.523 --> 00:26:48.653
Our dads were in California
-Devil's gate reservoir.

00:26:49.033 --> 00:26:51.054
They were setting a trap
for some kind of hell spawn.

00:26:52.233 --> 00:26:55.544
John was hiding, waiting,
and my dad was bait.

00:26:57.243 --> 00:26:58.864
That's just like john.

00:26:59.314 --> 00:27:02.183
Oh, I bet he dangled
bill like meat on a hook.

00:27:02.183 --> 00:27:02.973
Then what?

00:27:05.884 --> 00:27:06.963
The thing showed up.

00:27:07.394 --> 00:27:11.794
John got too eager, jumped out too soon,
and got my dad exposed out in the open.

00:27:13.794 --> 00:27:15.023
The thing turned around...

00:27:16.233 --> 00:27:17.223
And killed him.

00:27:21.854 --> 00:27:22.604
Not quite.

00:27:25.854 --> 00:27:26.513
What?

00:27:27.033 --> 00:27:27.523
What?

00:27:28.693 --> 00:27:29.733
See, it hurt him.

00:27:30.973 --> 00:27:32.163
It didn't kill him.

00:27:34.903 --> 00:27:36.604
You really don't know the truth, do you?

00:27:38.634 --> 00:27:40.033
I bet your momdoesn't, either.

00:27:40.503 --> 00:27:41.263
Know what?

00:27:41.554 --> 00:27:42.614
You see, bill...

00:27:44.273 --> 00:27:45.394
Was all clawed up.

00:27:47.074 --> 00:27:48.864
He was holding his insides in his hands.

00:27:50.273 --> 00:27:51.443
He was gargling and...

00:27:52.864 --> 00:27:54.943
Praying to see you and
Ellen one more time.

00:27:56.614 --> 00:27:57.804
So my dad...

00:28:00.243 --> 00:28:01.423
Killed him.

00:28:03.253 --> 00:28:05.644
He put him out of his
misery like a sick dog.

00:28:05.703 --> 00:28:06.243
You're lying.

00:28:06.243 --> 00:28:06.683
I'm not.

00:28:06.683 --> 00:28:07.673
It's true.

00:28:08.124 --> 00:28:11.483
My daddy shot your daddy in the head

00:28:11.483 --> 00:28:12.814
How could you know that?

00:28:12.814 --> 00:28:13.783
I hear things.

00:28:16.124 --> 00:28:17.394
Why are you doing this to me?

00:28:17.394 --> 00:28:18.624
Like daddy, like daughter.

00:28:18.624 --> 00:28:19.364
You're bait.

00:28:19.364 --> 00:28:20.193
Open up.

00:28:21.453 --> 00:28:22.884
That's a girl.

00:28:24.203 --> 00:28:24.983
Sam!

00:28:26.743 --> 00:28:28.314
I begged you to stop me, Dean!

00:28:28.544 --> 00:28:29.423
Put the knife down, damn it.

00:28:29.423 --> 00:28:31.104
I told you I can't fight it!

00:28:31.544 --> 00:28:33.874
My head feels like
its on fire, all right?

00:28:34.943 --> 00:28:38.114
Dean, kill me, or I'm gonna kill her.

00:28:39.094 --> 00:28:39.933
Please.

00:28:39.933 --> 00:28:41.114
You'd be doing me a favor.

00:28:42.814 --> 00:28:43.634
Shoot me.

00:28:47.044 --> 00:28:48.074
Shoot me!

00:28:57.374 --> 00:28:58.693
No, sammy.Come on.

00:29:02.953 --> 00:29:04.104
What the hells wrong with you, Dean?

00:29:05.463 --> 00:29:08.624
Are you that scared of being
alone that you'd rather let Jo die?

00:29:11.983 --> 00:29:14.044
That's holy water, you
demonic son of a bitch!

00:29:27.413 --> 00:29:29.713
He was possessed?

00:29:32.114 --> 00:29:34.114
Dean!

00:29:52.513 --> 00:29:56.114
So, who are you? I got lots of names.

00:30:03.513 --> 00:30:05.713
You've been in Sam since
he Disappeared, havent you?

00:30:05.814 --> 00:30:11.513
Should have seen your face when you
thought He murdered that guy. Pathetic.

00:30:16.913 --> 00:30:20.814
Why didn't you kill me?
You had a dozen chances.

00:30:25.114 --> 00:30:29.013
No, that would have been too
easy. Where's the fun in that?

00:30:29.114 --> 00:30:34.913
See, this was a test. I wanted to see If
I could push you far enough to waste Sam.

00:30:36.413 --> 00:30:39.114
I should have known you
wouldn't have the sack.

00:30:39.213 --> 00:30:41.614
Anyway, funs over now.

00:30:41.713 --> 00:30:45.913
Well, I hope you got your kicks
'cause you're gonna pay hell for this.

00:30:46.013 --> 00:30:50.814
How? You can't hurt me
- Not without hurting your little brother.

00:30:52.013 --> 00:31:00.413
See, I think you're gonna die, Dean
- You and every other hunter I can find.

00:31:02.114 --> 00:31:08.013
One look at Sams dewy, sensitive eyes,
And they'll let me right in that door.

00:32:19.713 --> 00:32:21.513
This is Dean. Leave a message.

00:32:50.114 --> 00:32:50.814
Dean!

00:32:51.913 --> 00:32:52.814
Dean!

00:32:56.814 --> 00:32:58.413
Take it easy.

00:32:59.314 --> 00:33:02.013
Where's Sam? I don't know.
Ive been looking for you.

00:33:02.114 --> 00:33:04.713
Come on. Get up.

00:33:12.114 --> 00:33:15.013
Okay. Dont be a baby!

00:33:15.314 --> 00:33:16.114
God.

00:33:17.713 --> 00:33:21.114
All right, almost. All
right, got it. Got it.

00:33:27.614 --> 00:33:31.114
God, youre a butcher. You're welcome.

00:33:31.913 --> 00:33:34.814
All right, are we done? Would you
give me two minutes to patch you up?

00:33:35.413 --> 00:33:37.713
You can't help Sam if
you're bleeding to death.

00:33:39.713 --> 00:33:42.614
So, how did you know
that he was possessed?

00:33:44.114 --> 00:33:48.314
I didnt. I just knew that
It couldn't have been him.

00:33:49.413 --> 00:33:51.614
Hey, Dean. Yeah.

00:33:52.913 --> 00:33:57.013
I know demons lie, But do
they ever tell the truth, too?

00:33:59.413 --> 00:34:04.614
Yeah, sometimes, I guess, especially
If they know it'll mess with your head.

00:34:07.614 --> 00:34:09.213
Why do you ask?

00:34:10.413 --> 00:34:13.614
Nothing. It doesn't matter.

00:34:13.713 --> 00:34:15.813
So, do you have any idea?
Where he's headed to next?

00:34:16.013 --> 00:34:21.213
So far, hes been going after the nearest hunter,
So, the closest one I know is in South Dakota.

00:34:21.413 --> 00:34:23.513
Okay, good. Im done. Lets go.

00:34:25.313 --> 00:34:29.513
You're not coming. The hell
I'm not. Im a part of this now.

00:34:29.713 --> 00:34:34.913
I can't say it more plain than this you try and
follow me, And I'll tie you right back to that post.

00:34:35.013 --> 00:34:38.114
This is my fight. Im not
getting Your blood on my hands.

00:34:38.213 --> 00:34:39.913
That's just how it's gonna be.

00:34:43.813 --> 00:34:47.513
Wait. Here.

00:34:49.913 --> 00:34:52.213
Take these. Theyll help with the pain.

00:34:55.413 --> 00:34:56.313
Thanks.

00:34:59.713 --> 00:35:01.713
I'll call you later, okay?

00:35:07.413 --> 00:35:09.313
No, you wont.

00:35:30.513 --> 00:35:32.114
Damn it.

00:35:44.713 --> 00:35:46.913
Sam. Hey, bobby.

00:35:47.114 --> 00:35:50.513
It's been a while. Come on in.

00:35:58.313 --> 00:36:03.013
So, what brings you? Working a job nearby,
and I thought I'd stop in and say hey.

00:36:03.213 --> 00:36:06.213
Where's Dean?

00:36:06.313 --> 00:36:09.114
Holed up somewhere with
a girl and a 12-Pack.

00:36:09.413 --> 00:36:15.413
Oh, yeah? Is she pretty? You ask
me, hes in way over his head.

00:36:18.013 --> 00:36:19.513
Well, its good to see you.

00:36:21.713 --> 00:36:22.513
To john.

00:36:24.713 --> 00:36:26.513
To dad.

00:36:40.313 --> 00:36:43.513
What'd you do? Little
holy water in the beer.

00:36:43.913 --> 00:36:49.013
Sam never would have noticed,
But, then, youre not Sam, are you?

00:36:49.213 --> 00:36:52.213
Don't try to con a con man.

00:37:02.213 --> 00:37:03.013
Ugh!

00:37:21.713 --> 00:37:25.413
Dean. Back from the dead.

00:37:25.713 --> 00:37:28.213
Getting to be a regular
thing for you, isnt it?

00:37:29.413 --> 00:37:30.113
Like a cockroach.

00:37:30.213 --> 00:37:32.813
How about I smack that smart-Ass
Right out of your mouth?

00:37:32.913 --> 00:37:33.913
Careful now.

00:37:34.013 --> 00:37:39.113
Wouldn't want to bruise this fine packaging
Oh, dont worry. This isn't gonna hurt Sam much.

00:37:40.013 --> 00:37:41.713
You, on the other hand...

00:37:45.613 --> 00:37:48.213
Feel like talking now?

00:37:48.713 --> 00:37:50.913
Sam's still my meat puppet.

00:37:51.713 --> 00:37:55.613
I'll make him bite off his tongue.
No, you won't be in him long enough.

00:37:56.213 --> 00:37:57.213
Bobby.

00:38:05.313 --> 00:38:12.413
Ee, whatever bitch-Boy master plan you demons Are
cooking up, youre not getting Sam, you understand me?

00:38:12.613 --> 00:38:15.613
'Cause I'm gonna kill
every one of you first.

00:38:27.413 --> 00:38:32.213
You really think that's what this is about
- The master plan?

00:38:32.713 --> 00:38:37.013
I don't give a rat's ass
about the master plan.

00:38:40.713 --> 00:38:44.813
Oops.Doesn't seem to be working.

00:38:45.313 --> 00:38:47.513
See, I learned a few new tricks.

00:39:03.913 --> 00:39:07.113
This isn't going like I
pictured. What's going on, bobby?

00:39:10.313 --> 00:39:12.413
It's a binding link!

00:39:12.713 --> 00:39:16.413
It's like a lock. Its locked
Itself inside Sams body.

00:39:16.513 --> 00:39:19.013
What the hell do we do? I don't know!

00:39:28.613 --> 00:39:31.713
There. Thats better.

00:39:40.613 --> 00:39:44.313
You know when people want to
describe The worst possible thing...

00:39:44.613 --> 00:39:46.713
They say it's like hell?

00:39:47.613 --> 00:39:51.913
Well, theres a reason for
that. Hell is like, uh...

00:39:54.713 --> 00:39:58.713
Well, its like hell, even for demons.

00:39:59.813 --> 00:40:05.513
It's a prison made of bone
and Flesh and blood and fear.

00:40:09.013 --> 00:40:11.713
And you sent me back there.

00:40:12.813 --> 00:40:16.913
Meg. No...Not anymore.

00:40:17.113 --> 00:40:18.813
Now I'm Sam.

00:40:21.213 --> 00:40:22.613
By the way...

00:40:24.013 --> 00:40:27.413
I saw your dad there. He says "howdy."

00:40:28.013 --> 00:40:34.113
All that I had to hold on to was that I would
Climb out one day and that I was gonna torture you,

00:40:34.413 --> 00:40:38.413
Nice and slow, like pulling
the wings off an insect.

00:40:39.013 --> 00:40:43.813
But whatever I do to you, its nothing
compared To what you do to yourself, is it?

00:40:44.313 --> 00:40:46.413
I can see it in your eyes, Dean.

00:40:46.713 --> 00:40:50.213
You're worthless. You
couldn't save your dad

00:40:50.413 --> 00:40:55.713
And deep down, you know that
You can't save your brother.

00:40:56.613 --> 00:40:58.813
They'd have been better off without you.

00:41:28.013 --> 00:41:29.513
Sammy?

00:41:33.513 --> 00:41:35.713
Did I miss anything?

00:41:49.013 --> 00:41:52.413
By the way, you really
look like crap, Dean.

00:41:53.113 --> 00:41:55.113
Yeah, right back at you.

00:42:01.013 --> 00:42:02.413
What is it, bobby?

00:42:03.313 --> 00:42:06.513
You boys ever hear of a
hunter Named Steve Wandell?

00:42:07.813 --> 00:42:09.713
Why do you ask?

00:42:10.413 --> 00:42:16.413
Just heard from a friend, wandells dead
- Murdered in his own house.

00:42:18.013 --> 00:42:20.413
You wouldn't know anything about that.

00:42:20.613 --> 00:42:23.213
No, sir.Never heard of the guy. Dean.

00:42:23.313 --> 00:42:25.813
Good. Keep it that way.

00:42:26.013 --> 00:42:29.713
Wandell's buddies are looking for
Someone or something to string up.

00:42:30.013 --> 00:42:32.613
They're not gonna slow
down to listen to reason.

00:42:33.013 --> 00:42:35.013
You understand what I'm saying?

00:42:36.513 --> 00:42:38.413
We better hit the road...

00:42:38.713 --> 00:42:41.613
If, uh, you can remember
where we parked the car.

00:42:41.813 --> 00:42:43.713
Here. Take these.

00:42:46.413 --> 00:42:51.313
What are they? Charms.
Theyll fend off possession.

00:42:51.413 --> 00:42:55.613
That demon's still out there. This will
Stop it from getting back up in you.

00:42:55.813 --> 00:42:59.613
That sounds vaguely dirty,
but, uh, thanks. You're welcome.

00:43:00.113 --> 00:43:03.913
You boys be careful, now. You too.

00:43:29.213 --> 00:43:31.313
You okay?

00:43:32.913 --> 00:43:34.613
Sam?

00:43:36.413 --> 00:43:37.713
Is that you in there?

00:43:42.213 --> 00:43:44.513
I was awake for some of it, Dean.

00:43:46.713 --> 00:43:54.213
I watched myself kill Wandell with my own
two hands. I saw the light go out in his eyes.

00:43:56.413 --> 00:43:58.113
It must have been awful.

00:44:00.513 --> 00:44:02.513
That's not my point.

00:44:04.213 --> 00:44:06.613
I almost carved up jota.

00:44:06.713 --> 00:44:09.413
But no matter what I
did, you wouldn't shoot.

00:44:10.013 --> 00:44:12.513
It was the right move,
sam.It wasn't you.

00:44:12.613 --> 00:44:16.513
Yeah, this time. What about next time?

00:44:20.113 --> 00:44:27.913
Sam, when dad told me that I might have to
kill you, It was only if I couldn't save you.

00:44:28.513 --> 00:44:31.413
Now, if it's the last thing
I do, I'm gonna save you.

00:44:39.913 --> 00:44:40.313
What?

00:44:41.313 --> 00:44:42.413
Nothing.

00:44:43.913 --> 00:44:45.413
Dean, what?

00:44:45.513 --> 00:44:51.213
Dude, you, like, full-On had a girl
inside you for, Like, a whole week.

00:44:54.213 --> 00:44:55.613
That's pretty naughty.



00:03:16.413 --> 00:03:17.913
